window.products.push({"id":76213,"name":"Replacement For LG LFX28968SB Refrigerator Water Filter - by Refresh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f-BxbTdUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"\" \" Refresh R-9690 Replacement For LG LT700P / ADQ36006101 Refrigerator Water Filter Certified by NSF international against NSF/ANSF standard 42 (ISO 9001) for materials and structural integrity requirements. Gold seal Awarded Filters by Water Quality Association Delivers Clean, Crisp, Clear Water That Looks & Tastes Great. Does Not Remove Minerals Which May Be Beneficial to Health Reduces Select Chemicals, Herbicides, Insecticides, Sand, Silt, Sediment, Rust, Chlorine & Other Contaminants Comes with 6-month life-cycle, providing much more purified fresh water up to 200 Gallons. Easy Installation & Operation. Replacement water filter for following models: LG Refrigerator Water Filters: ADQ36006101, ADQ36006101-S, ADQ36006102, ADQ36006102-S, LT700P, LT700PC Kenmore Refrigerator Water Filters: 9690, 469690, 4609690000, 48231783705 Description : The Refresh R-9690 Replacement Water Filter For LG LT700P / Kenmore 9690 is a premium quality water filter that defines freshwater. Chemicals such as chlorine and other contaminants are the main reason for various health issues. The filter serves as a guard for the water and it filters chlorine easily. It also removes bad smell in no time, plus it improves taste of water by purifying and eliminating the chemical content. The filter provides cleaner, fresher water and ice. The filter makes sure that you get all the essential minerals by retaining them while filtering. Designed to purify the unclean water and making it suitable for drinking, the filter completely protects your family because in the end health comes first. Steps to Install the replacement filter without any extra tools: Push button to open filter cover. Pull the old cartridge down. Pull out the filter. Holding the new filter in your hands, remove all packaging and the sanitary end-cap. Insert the new filter into the manifold hole until it is seated. Push the cover back up until it clicks into place","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f-BxbTdUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"636643","source_asin":"B07TY4MTN3","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-76213","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TY4MTN3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TY4MTN3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":76214,"name":"Broan-NuTone BKSA130WW Sahale 30-inch Under-Cabinet 4-Way Convertible Range Hood with 2-Speed Exhaust Fan and Light, 300 Max Blower CFM, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":162.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41S6ZmIxWUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Upgrade your kitchen with the Broan-NuTone Sahale 30-inch Under-Cabinet Convertible Range Hood! This versatile range hood insert offers a complete solution to your ventilation needs by providing both an exhaust fan and overhead light for your stove. This range hood provides a MAX 300 CFM and 5.0 Sones blower performance to quickly remove smoke and cooking odors from the air, and the hidden 2-speed rocker switch allows for quick fan adjustments and provides the ideal level of ventilation every time you cook. It also features the Captur system - an advanced blower design with a forward positioned centric inlet to remove smoke and odors faster. The 2-level built-in lights accept up to 50-watt halogen bulbs (not included) to evenly illuminate your cooking area, and they are also controlled by a hidden rocker switch for ease of use. This sleek white-colored steel range hood fits neatly underneath cabinets, and it features mitered sides and a hemmed bottom with no sharp edges to help ensure safety and provide a more decorative look. The one-piece dishwasher-safe open mesh aluminum grease filters offer easy cleaning so you can maintain optimum grease capture and keep your kitchen ventilated. This 4-way convertible range hood unit measures 19.875\" x 30\" x 5\" and installs as 3.25\" x 10\" ducted opening connected vertically or horizontally with damper, 7\" round vertical ducting (damper sold separately), or as non-ducted with air recirculation (filter sold separately) to provide versatile installation options at least 18\" above the cooktop. It includes hidden louvers on top of the hood that exhaust away from the cabinetry. It can work in an ADA-compliant application as well. It is both UL-Listed and HVI-2100 Certified for safety and protection, and it includes a 1 year limited warranty. Enhance your kitchen with the Broan-NuTone BKSA130WW Range Hood!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41S6ZmIxWUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Broan-NuTone","source_asin":"B0BKB9M7FX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-76214","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKB9M7FX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKB9M7FX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
