window.products.push({"id":76251,"name":"Empava 30\" Under Cabinet Range Hood Ultra Slim-Ducted Exhaust Kitchen Vent with Push Button Controls-Dual Sealed Aluminum Motor-Permanent Filters LEDs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":289.28,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W7vzpDJJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The 30\" 400 CFM Ducted Under Cabinet Range Hood with the USA & Canada ETL Certified is a Perfect Combination of Style and Practicality. The Slim and Light Vent Hood Will Transform Your Kitchen into a Modern, Tidy, and Cozy Space. The Ultra-Quiet Dual Sealed Motor do an Incredible Job at Quickly Remove Smoke and Other Cooking Odors from the Air. Come with a Gently Rounded Corners Design, Creates a Focal Point with a Distinctive Modern Look. Removable, Reusable, Dishwasher-Safe Stainless-Steel Filter For Easy Cleaning and Maintenance. Two Bright LEDs Shine Light on Your Stovetop for Better Cooking Visibility. During the Past Years, Empava Range Hoods Have Been a Very Popular Choice for Kitchen Upgrades and New Builds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W7vzpDJJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Empava","source_asin":"B0964JSVV4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-76251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0964JSVV4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0964JSVV4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":76252,"name":"IKTCH Upgrated 36\"Under Cabinet Range Hood, 900 CFM Ducted Range Hood with 4 Speed Fan, Black Stainless Steel & Tempered Glass Range Hood 36 inch with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":339.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EHiDxVCnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Gesture-sensing Control, Keys Without Stains】IKTCH under cabinet range hood is composed of a black crystal glass and an 1MM thick stainless steel panel. Meticulous spray painting makes the appearance more elegant. The gesture sensing function and remote control are newly added to the original touch switch panel.Even if your hands are stained with oil,don't worry about dirtying the it. 【900 CFM Powerful Suction, 0 Residue of Fumes】900 CFM super suction range hood 36 inch is equipped with 2 motors and balanced fans to instantly absorb fumes and cooking smells in all directions. Even if there is an aftertaste, IKTCH's custom-made 1-15 minute adjustable timer will automatically clean up for you,keeping the kitchen environment fresh and natural. 【Bright Kitchen Nightlight, Wide Vision for Cooking】Equipped with 2Pcs 3W energy-saving LED lights, the brightness can be adjusted with touch to meet your cooking needs. This range hood 36 inch under cabinet'lights are bright and soft without hurting the eyes,and instantly improves the visibility at night. 【Quiet Working, Telephone Call While Cooking】With a shock-absorbing and stabilizing ring, 4-speed settings customize your kitchen stove vents to adjust suction and noise levels. The noise level of range hood is set at a minimum of 40dB and a maximum of only 65dB, allowing you to stay away from the noise and immerse yourself in cooking. 【Most Comprehensive Technical Support】 10 years technical support on motor, 5 years technical support on switch control and LED lamps. IKTCH are a Manufactory that specialized in range hood solutions for more than 10 years. Feel free to reach us if you have questions during use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EHiDxVCnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IKTCH","source_asin":"B0BJZZ54NR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-76252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJZZ54NR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJZZ54NR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
