window.products.push({"id":76286,"name":"Ice Maker Machine for Countertop, Self-Cleaning Function, 26Lbs/24H Portable Ice Maker, 9 Ice Ready in 6 Mins, Compact Ice Maker with Ice Scoop & Bask","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d1-tIUJ-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍺【SELF-CLEANING FUNCTION】Ice maker countertop features auto-cleaning function. Just press \"ON/OFF\" button for more than 5 seconds to enter the automatic cleaning function. (Please clean your ice machine with lemonade and soda regularly). 🍺【QUICK & POWERFUL】FOOING ice maker machine can churn out its first batch of ice in just seven minutes. Thanks to a high-power cooling process, it can produce up to 26 lbs./12 kg of ice in 24 hrs per day. with its 2-liter/68 oz water reservoir. The crunchy, yet chewy nugget ice it makes is perfect for chilling any cocktail or blended beverage. 🍺【LARGE OR SMALL ICE SELECTABLE】FOOING ice machine can make up to two different sizes of ice (small and large), fitting all of your cocktail-making needs. The ice maker indicators alert you to take out the ice cubes when the basket is full, as well as to add water when the machine is running low. 🍺【SMART INDICATOR ＆ LOW-NOISE】With an easy-to-use control panel, you can also track its ice-making production through the clear window. The environmentally-friendly, low-noise machine boasts a high-power compressor for fast ice making, fast cooling effect and low consumption with powerful compressor, high quality copper aluminum fin condenser and 21g R600a refrigerant. 🍺【WARRANTY & SUPPORT】1 Year for Ice Maker Machine: Come with a food-grade removable ice basket, an ice scoop, easily transfer the ice cubes from ice maker machine. AONESY Ice Makers purchased directly from authorized resellers have limited 1-year parts and labor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d1-tIUJ-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOOING","source_asin":"B0978YQ94K","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-76286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0978YQ94K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0978YQ94K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":76287,"name":"WPW10208415 Dryer Washer Door Hinge Assembly Compatible With Whirlpool Duet Washer Maytag Front Loader Dryer - Replaces AP6041529, W10208415, PD000425","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rzPjkHQPL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Description: This hinge connects the machine's door to the machine to hold it in place during operation and when the machine is being loaded and unloaded. If the washing machine door does not stay open when loading the machine, the hinge may be damaged. Over time and with regular use, the door hinge may become warped or fall out and need to be replaced.  Disconnect the power source from the washing machine or dryer before replacing the hinge on the door. Remove the screws holding the door to the machine and set them to the side. Lay the door on a flat surface and remove the damaged hinge. Attach the new hinge to the door using the screws removed from the old one. Reattach the door to the machine. Reconnect the power and make sure the door functions correctly. This door hinge is made of heavy-duty metal and is sold individually. The hinge does not come with screws.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rzPjkHQPL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FBULWSEC","source_asin":"B09SP1LRYP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-76287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SP1LRYP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SP1LRYP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":76288,"name":"Brewslang Single Reusable K-cup Coffee Filter for Keurig K40, K45, K50, K55, K60, K65, K70, K75 - 6 Pack+","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-bAav7HpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Single Reusable K-cup Coffee Filter is made from 100% BPA-free materials. This unit has a an integrated stainless steel laser perforated mesh that ensures a clean full and even extraction of the very best attributes your coffee has to offer. No need to remove the Keurig K-cup Holder or Filter Holster, simply fill the Reusable K-cup Coffee Filter, place it in your machine and brew normally. The use of the Reusable K-cup Coffee Filter allows you to reduce your impact on the environment, lower your costs, double your value and increase your personal choices. The Reusable K-cup Coffee Filter is not compatible with Keurig 2.0 and Keurig Vue. Ships out within one business day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-bAav7HpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brewslang","source_asin":"B00PFD72F8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-76288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PFD72F8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PFD72F8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
