window.products.push({"id":76476,"name":"Antarctic Star Mini Upright Freezer -2.3 cu.ft Compact freezer with Removable Shelves and Adjustable Thermostat,Better for Home/Kitchen/Office(Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":224.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K9Vx4gHRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Compact Chest Freezer Dimensions：2.3 cubic feet free standing Chest Freezer Measures: 22.05”(W)*23.23”(D)*34.84”(H).The removable slide-out chrome frame provides a means to store more food storage needs, like meat, aquatic products, cold drinks, quick-freezing and other purposes, sized to store your favourite food well while taking up minimal space, suitable for party, large families, garage, basement, apartment, kitchen Temperature Control Adjustment:7 grade temperature ranges, the range of the temperature control is form position 1 the cold to 7 the coldest, level 0 means Turn Off, approximate temperature range of 6.8°F to7.6°F.“0”grade( OFF ) stops cooling the freezer.Power on light (red) & Run light (green) indicate proper functioning of the unit. Energy Saving & Low Noise: Using R600a high efficiency and low energy consumption compressor, this freezer can cool quickly. Only 0.45 kilowatt-hour power needed per day. In addition, noise below 40 db, promise a sweet dream. FUNCTION UPGRADES:freezer have designed some additional functions that are different from those on the market according to people's habits and needs.ADJUSTABLE FEET: keep the machine from being corroded by moisture on the ground. ADJUSTABLE SHELVES: You can place items of multiple sizes. BUILT-IN HANDLE: not only easier to open the freezer door, but also makes the freezer more simple and beautiful. MULTIPLE SCENES: The original intention of freezer design is to meet the needs of more people, and college students can use it in the dorm. Mom and Dad can use it in the kitchen, living room and bedroom at home or in the apartment. It will also be a portable partner for you when you travel. And this partner is very quiet, you will feel very comfortable when you use it. NOTE: You'd better put the small freezer upright for at least 24 hours before using it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K9Vx4gHRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Antarctic Star","source_asin":"B08ZWQDTXS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-76476","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZWQDTXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZWQDTXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":76477,"name":"Kismile Chest Freezer, 7 cu ft Compact Mini Freezer With Low Noise & Energy Saving, Deep Freezer with Removable Basket, Ideal for Kitchen, Bedroom, Ap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Yrd1GyoVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Compact Design with a Big Capacity】The space-saving design of this 7.0 cubic foot free standing chest freezer measures 35.63\" (W)*21.65\" (D)*33.46\" (H). The Large Capacity can be used for a variety of things, including breast milk, meat, aquatic items, cold drinks, rapid freezing, and more. It could be utilized at home, in dorms, in the kitchen, or at the office. 【Adjustable Thermostat Control】Using the 7-grade temperature control, set the desired temperature. \"1\" is the warmest number, and \"7\" is the coldest. The freezer's cooling system is turned off by pressing \"0\" (OFF). The temperature can be changed from 6.8 to -7.6°F. The unit's power on (red) and run (green) lights show that it is operational. 【Energy Saving & Quiet】This chest freezer can cool quickly thanks to the R600a high efficiency and low energy consumption compressor. Per day, only 0.6 kilowatt-hours of power are required. Furthermore, noise levels below 40 decibels guarantee a restful night's sleep. 【Design that is user-friendly】Our deep freezer chest's door hinges are angled at 45° to 90°. It makes storing food more convenient. Small items can be kept, slid, and moved with ease in the removable storage basket. The contents of the meat freezer were easily visible beneath it. To balance the freezer on an uneven surface, it has adjustable leveling legs. 【Contents of the Package】1 deep freezer, 1x basket, 1 user's handbook are included in the package. Before using the tiny freezer, leave it upright for at least 24 hours. And 7*24h customer support, if there is any questions, just feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Yrd1GyoVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kismile","source_asin":"B0BZV8999P","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-76477","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZV8999P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZV8999P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
