window.products.push({"id":76502,"name":"Waterspecialist 469690 ADQ36006101 Refrigerator Water Filter and Air Filter, Replacement for LG® LT700P®, Kenmore® 9690, 46-9690, ADQ36006102 and LT12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z49nmIxAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Replacement for models: LG LT700P, LT700PCS, ADQ36006101, ADQ36006101-S, ADQ36006101S, ADQ36006102, ADQ36006102-S, ADQ36006102S, 9690, 46-9690, KENMORE 469690, WSL-3, WLF-01, RFC1200A, CWMF041, BLS LT700P, APF1400, PF01, PL-500, WF-117, R-9690, OP-1200A. Compatible with: LFCS31626S; LFD20786SB; LFD22786SB; LFX21976ST; LFX25976SB; LFX25978SB; LFX25991ST; LFX25992ST; LFX28968D; LFX28978SB; LFX28979SB; LFX28991ST; LFX28992ST; LFX28995ST; LFX29927SB; LFX29937ST; LFX29945ST; LFX31915SB; LFX31925SB; LFX31935ST; LFX31945ST; LFX31945ST; LFX31995ST; LFX32945ST; LFX33975ST; LFXC24726D; LFXC24766; LFXC24766S; LFXS24623B; LFXS24663S; LFXS27566S; LFXS29626B; LFXS29766S; LFXS30726B; LFXS30766D; LFXS30786S; LFXS32726S; LFXS32736D; LFXS32766S; LMX21986ST. The Waterspecialist refrigerator water filter features filtration performance is comparable to the original brand. It is also certified by authority NSF 42 and 372. Far different from generic brand, Waterspecialist only adopts 100% superior coconut shell carbon block to improve taste and odor. Great filtration: Waterspecialist refrigerator filters can remove many harmful substances in water including chlorine, taste and odor. This has been tested and proven by an independent third-party laboratory. Premium filter material: Waterspecialist selected BPA-free and food-grade filter housing that passed NSF 372 certification for lead-free filtration. We also adopt 100% natural coconut shell carbon block that contains larger surface area and more micropores than inferior carbon block. Thus, the filter cartridge can efficiently remove chlorine, bad taste and odor. Perfect fit: Waterspecialist combines precision measurement technology to produce 100% fit refrigerator filters with exquisite engineering designs, unlike inferior replacement filters that can cause water leakage issues. Also, Waterspecialist saves you time and hassle by offering tool-free refrigerator filter replacements. Fresh-tasting water: The 100% natural coconut shell carbon block absorbs more impurities than low-priced and mixed carbon block. The Waterspecialist refrigerator filter provides you a unique filtration experience. The air filter keeps your food's tastes and smells separated, making the air inside your refrigerator fresh. Food-grade materials: We selected BPA-free and food-grade filter housing. Waterspecialist is here to protect your water safety. Monthly install stickers: Expired replacement filters might cause an accumulation of pollutants and only achieve low-standard filtration performance. Therefore, Waterspecialist filters come with date labels that remind you to change it on time. Besides, the filter life is 6 months or 200 gallons (varies based on the water condition). LG is a registered trademark of LG CORP. LG is used for reference purposes only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z49nmIxAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waterspecialist","source_asin":"B07Y9WWLSD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-76502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y9WWLSD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y9WWLSD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
