window.products.push({"id":76509,"name":"BougeRV Ice Maker Countertop, 12V/24V DC Portable Ice Maker, Small Self-Cleaning Ice Maker 19lbs per Day for Outdoor Camping RV Home Kitchen Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TDpm-ApOL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Operating in 12V/24V DC Power] Unlike other traditional ice makers, the BougeRV ice maker can be used in not only AC power but also 12V/24V DC Power. Hooked up with solar panels and solar generators, satisfying your outdoor need. You can also use the car charging port to run this ice maker. [Efficient Ice Making] BougeRV portable ice maker offers 2 sizes of ice to choose from. The popular bullet-shaped ice is slow to melt and not easy to clump together and produces 9 cubes in 9mins. Fill 1.5L of water into the water tank, maximum ice capacity can reach 19lbs in 24 hours. It's perfect for parties/camping trips/truck use, creating a more enjoyable atmosphere. [Noise<50dB] Considering the ice making at night, the BougeRV ice maker machine is designed as quiet as it can, so you can enjoy a cool night without bothering your roommates and family members. [User-friendly and Self-Cleaning]With only the POWER and SELECT buttons, this compact ice maker is easy to operate. Press the POWER button for 3s to enter the self-cleaning mode to clean itself. You can switch to the L or S mode to choose the different sizes of the ice cubes by the SELECT button. When the ice basket is full, the indicator light keeps flashing. When the reservoir is empty, the light also keeps flashing to remind you to add water. [Warranty and Service] BougeRV guarantees you a 1-YEAR warranty for the compressor and all other accessories. If you have any questions about the BougeRV ice maker, please reach out to BougeRV firstly, and we provide hassle-free after-sale customer service. (Package included: dc power cord, ac power cord, removable ice basket, ice shovel, and user manual).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TDpm-ApOL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BougeRV","source_asin":"B09YRFYFMH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-76509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YRFYFMH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YRFYFMH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":76510,"name":"Panda Full-Automatic Portable Machine, 1.34 Cu.ft,10lbs Capacity, Light Gray, PAN56MGP3, 10 Wash Programs, Compact Top Load Cloth Washer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61imqvdVv1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Boasting a unique, space-saving design, the new model of Panda Compact 1. 34 cu. ft. Portable Load Washer makes your laundry easy and simple. It is compact which is perfect for small loads for daily usage, you can use it in apartment, dorms, RVs, and it just the right size to be the second washer in your house. This portable top load upper drainage washing machine offers 10 different washing programs set with the touch of a button. 5 water level settings to make sure your clothes come out as clean as can be. Its sturdy and quiet design accommodates up to 10 lbs. of laundry in its stainless-steel drum which is durable and resists rust and chipping. Lightweight to carry around, regular 3 prongs 110 Voltage can be plugged anywhere. 310 Watts of motor rate, it saves the electricity bills. Brand: Panda Model: PAN56MGP3 Color of body: Light Gray Color of lid: Purple Volume Capacity: 1. 34 Cu. ft Wash Program: 10 Water Level: 5 Tub Material: Stainless Steel Dimensions: 20 * 19 * 34 inch Weight: 51 lbs 1 Year manufacturer Please acknowledge before purchasing: *This machine only has ONE water inlet that can be connected to a standard faucet using the inlet hose and quick adapter in the package. Please adjust water temperature by the faucet. **To ensure the quality of products, all of the machines were water tested by the manufacture before transporting to our warehouse, so you will have chance to see water mark or water left outside or inside the machine. ***When unpacking the machine, you might see a black rectangle plastic piece located at the bottom of the machine, it is the motor protection part used to protect the motor during shipment. It is not part of the machine, please remove it before using the machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61imqvdVv1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panda","source_asin":"B08Q94RSR3","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-76510","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q94RSR3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q94RSR3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
