window.products.push({"id":76550,"name":"Waterdrop 4396508 Refrigerator Water Filter, Replacement for Whirlpool 4396508, 4396510, 4392857, Kenmore 46-9010, NLC240V, EveryDrop Filter 5, EDR5RX","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71odoTWoVPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The replacement for 4396508 & 4396510 Whirlpool water filter, despite the affordable price, offer the best - a mix of prior filtration performance and important certifications from the well-known regulatory body in the industry – NSF 42 and NSF 372 certificates. Thanks to the 100% Sri Lankan superior coconut shell carbon block, this replacement for Kenmore 469010 refrigerator water filter is effective against various contaminants. [Advance filtration process] If you have been looking for a way to reduce harmful impurities from your drinking water, the solution is here. Waterdrop replacement for EDR5RXD1 refrigerator water filter effectively filters off contaminants from your water. These include chlorine, bad taste and odor and other suspended particles tested by the third-party laboratory. While the impurities are reduced, every beneficial mineral in your water is kept, ensuring that your body functions properly. [Perfect fit] You can now worry less about water leakages due to unfit or loose replacement refrigerator filters. This Waterdrop refrigerator filter replacement is made from an advanced industrial automation system and a precision measurement technology that ensures that you get the same fit as the original. Moreover, you need no tool to install this refrigerator water filter. Just follow the installation guidelines we have provided, and you will be done in minutes. [Top-notch filter material] Here, you are getting a significant improvement to the less-efficient charcoal filter that relies on coal, wood, walnut shell, and apricot shell to filter water. The filter material in this filter is a 100% Sri Lankan selected coconut shell carbon block, with 2x larger surface area and more micropores. [Great-tasting water] Another essential benefit of the 100% natural coconut shell carbon block is the enhanced adsorption capability. Unlike the cheap and mixed carbon block, the filter material in the Waterdrop refrigerator filter improves the overall taste of your water. [Complimentary month install stickers] You do not have to go the extra mile to monitor your refrigerator filter’s lifespan. This Waterdrop refrigerator filter is shipped with complimentary month install stickers that help track the service life at all times. Now you know when you have exhausted the 300 gallons or 6 months of pure water, depending on the water conditions. [BPA-free and food-grade materials] At Waterdrop, we prioritize your safety. This is why we have used only safe materials in this refrigerator filter, as verified by the NSF 372 certification for lead-free materials. [Purified with love] We believe everyone has the right to drink pure water wherever they are. We are not only about business; we hope to use our technology to benefit more people. A portion of every purchase you make is donated to provide children in water-scarce regions in Africa with clean, pure water. Compatible models: Whirlpool Filter 5, Kenmore Filter 5, EveryDrop Filter 5, EveryDrop 8212652, 469085, 8212652, 4392857R, 4392922, 4396508P, 4396508T, 4396509, 4396509P, 4396510P, 4396510T, 4396562, 4396563, 4396918, 46-9010, 46 9010, 46-9902, 46 9902, 9085, 46-9908, 46- 9908, 4396547, 4396163, 4396548, 4396164, 2255709, 2203980, 2305767, 2305768, 2255518, 2186444, 2203980, WF-NL240V, WF-L400V, WFL500, WF-L500, WFLC400, WFLC400V, WF-NLC250, WF-NL300, WF-l500, NLC240V, NL240, NL240V, NL300 Compatible models: L400, L400V, LC400, LC400V, WFL400, FL400V, AQUA CREST AQF-4396508, Denali Pure WF-4396508, PWF-NL240V, WE-NLC240V, PUR NLC240V, Pure Line PL-600, PurePlus PP-RWF0500A, Clear Choice CLCH100, HDX FMW-2, Refresh R-9010, WaterSentinel WSW-2, Tier1 RWF1020, Waterfall Filter WFC1001, Aqua Fresh WF285, EXCELPURE EP-4396508, Odoga WFEK00008, EcoAqua EFF-6002A, FilterLogic FL-RF02, One Purify RFC0500A, Waterdrop WD-4396508","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71odoTWoVPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B079Z1SXJP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-76550","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079Z1SXJP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B079Z1SXJP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":76551,"name":"OKADA Portable Ice Maker Countertop - 9 Ice Cubes Ready in 6 Mins - Makes 26 lbs Ice in 24 hrs - Electric Ice Making Machine with Basket and Ice Scoop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZAg40CF2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUIET & QUICKLY MAKE ICE IN 6 MINUTES - The ice making machine can produce up to 26 pounds of ice in 24 hrs. Within 6 to 13 minutes, you will begin to see the first batch of 9 bullet-shape ice cubes. You wont need an ice tray again. The ice maker stores up to 2 pounds of ice at a time in its insulated storage bin. Running at only 38 decibels, you can enjoy fresh ice cubes without bearing harsh noises. TWO TYPES OF CLEANING METHODS - This portable ice maker features a built-in self-cleaning function for an easy daily clean. Just press and hold the ON/OFF button for 5 seconds to start the cleaning mode. The fully-open design lid allows the machine and you to clean the machine thoroughly. Regular cleaning helps mantain the ice maker for longer lasting use and it will keep your ice cubes clear of unwanted cloudyness. COMPACT & PORTABLE ICE MAKER - With dimensions of 9.5 x 13.9 x 13in, this countertop ice maker unit is small enough to move on and off the counter. It is compact, portable and will work anywhere there is a standard electrical outlet to plug it into. No water or drain lines are needed making it a useful addition for boats, kitchens, restraunts, bars, office, and more. SMART INDICATOR & TWO ICE SIZE OPTIONS - The ice maker indicator light automatically lights up when the ice basket is full. The machine will automatically stop producing ice when it is full and will stop when water needs to be added to the machine. Meanwhile, you can select small or large ice cubes depending on your preference. The bullet-shaped ice cubes have a hollow middle which generates a flow of liquids through the center, cooling the drinks quicker. Great for parties and events. ADVANCED CUSTOMER SERVICE - A removable basket and ice scoop are included for easy serving. Our Countertop Portable Ice Maker is covered with a one year worry free warranty. Its made from food-grade materials to provide you with healthy and safe ice cubes. Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions about our countertop ice maker. Our technical advice and local customer service are provided for your convience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZAg40CF2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cloud Mountain","source_asin":"B08BHP1Z7X","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-76551","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BHP1Z7X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BHP1Z7X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
