window.products.push({"id":76649,"name":"Waterdrop MWF Water Filter for GE® Refrigerators, Replacement for GE® MWF, SmartWater® MWFP, MWFA, GWF, HDX FMG-1, WFC1201, RWF1060, 197D6321P006, Ken","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KSbhz-S9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Waterdrop WD-F13 refrigerator water filter replacement for GE MWF, despite its affordable price, offers the best - a mix of prior filtration performance and important certifications from the well-known regulatory body in the industry – NSF 42 and NSF 372 certificates. GE is a registered trademark of General Electric Company. GE is used for reference purposes only. [Replacement for filter models] GE MWF Refrigerator Water Filter, GE MWF Water Filter, GE GWF Water Filter, GE MWFP Water Filter, GE MWFA Water Filter, GE MWFAP Water Filter, GE MWFINT Water Filter, GE GWF01 Water Filter, GE GWF06 Water FIlter, GE GWFA Water Filter, GE FMG-1 Water FIlter, GE WMF Water Filter, Kenmore 46-9991 Water Filter, PL-100, GF-MWF, WD-F13, EBL7771, CF8, WFC1201, AQF-FF13, RWF0600A, RWF0600AH, PP-RWF0600A, FL-RF13, WS613B, MB-F13, PF8, RWF1060, CWMF031, WSG-1,CLCH102, CW-G1 [Compatible with] GSL25IGXNLS, GSL25JFRFBS, GSL25JFXNLB, GSL25KGREBS, GSL25QGPDBS, GSS22QFMCCC, GSS23HMHECES, GSS23LGTACC, GSS23QSTASS, GSS23WSTASS, GSS25GFXJBB, HSS25GFPHWW, PFCS1NFZASS, PFSF6PKXCBB, PFSS2MJYCSS, PFSS6PKXBSS, PFSS9PKYASS, PGCS1NFZASS, PSE25KSHEHSS, PSE25KSHSS, PSS26MGPBBB, PSS26MSTDSS, PSS26SGPASS, PSS29NHMBBB, PZS23KSEBFSS, PZS25KSEBFSS, BSS25JFRWW, BSS25JSRSS, BSY25GFMCC, BSY25GFMCWW, CFCP1NIYSS, CFCP1RKBSS, CFSP5RKBSS, CZS22MSKSS, CZS25TSESS, DSE25JMHES. [360° comprehensive protection] Be aware of the claimed certification. Our filters are comprehensively certified by the NSF 42&372 test from each components to the filter cartridge as a whole, providing you all-round protection from harmful impurities. [Advance filtration process] If you have been looking for a way to reduce harmful impurities from your drinking water, the solution is here. This Waterdrp replacement water filter effectively filters off impurities from your water. [Perfect fit] You can now worry less about water leakages due to unfit or loose replacement refrigerator filters. This Waterdrop refrigerator filter replacement is made from an advanced industrial automation system and a precision measurement technology that ensures that you get the same fit as the original. Moreover, you need no tool to install this refrigerator water filter. Just follow the installation guidelines we have provided, and you will be done in minutes. [Top-notch filter material] Here, you are getting a significant improvement to the less-efficient charcoal filter that relies on coal, wood, walnut shell, and apricot shell to filter water. The filter material in this filter is a 100% Sri Lankan selected coconut shell carbon block, with 2x larger surface area and more micropores. Unlike the cheap and mixed carbon block, the filter material in the Waterdrop refrigerator filter improves the overall taste of your water. [Complimentary month install stickers] You do not have to go the extra mile to monitor your refrigerator filter’s lifespan. This Waterdrop refrigerator filter is shipped with complimentary month install stickers that help track the service life at all times. Now you know when you have exhausted the 300 gallons or 6 months of pure water, depending on the water conditions. [BPA-free and food-grade materials] At Waterdrop, we prioritize your safety. This is why we have used only safe materials in this refrigerator filter, as verified by the NSF 372 certification for lead-free materials. [Purified with love] We believe everyone has the right to drink pure water wherever they are. We are not only about business; we hope to use our technology to benefit more people. A portion of every purchase you make is donated to provide children in water-scarce regions in Africa with clean, pure water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KSbhz-S9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B0C5PR3NWJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-76649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5PR3NWJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5PR3NWJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
