window.products.push({"id":76710,"name":"Tupkee Large 12-Cup Coffee Filters - 1000-Count (9.75\" x 4.25\") Tall Walled to Prevent Overflow - Chlorine Free White - Compatible with Bunn Commercia","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614NwcMqFmL._AC_SL1254_.jpg","description":"A GREAT CUP OF COFFEE STARTS WITH GREAT FILTERS To brew a delicious coffee or tea, you have to use premium quality filters to release the delicious taste and delightful aroma of your special blends,  Filters need to be big enough, strong enough, and designed correctly to release the delicious taste and delightful aroma of your special blendsTupkee 12 Cup High quality Industrial Basket Style Commercial Large Coffee Filters is the ideal filter to deliver a rich flavorful cup of coffee every timeFor use with 12-Cup Commercial Coffee Brewers - Compatible with Wilbur Curtis, Bloomfield, Bunn Coffee Maker, and Most 12-cup Home Machines Features and Benefits PREMIUM QUALITY PAPER FOR A RICH, ROBUST CUP OF COFFEE – Tupkee coffee filters 12 cup are made from heavy-weight special grade paper, so the water flows properly through coffee ground, and prevents grounds from filtering through, allowing for better immersion of the grounds in hot water, that preserves the taste and provides the perfect extraction for a richer more flavorful coffee  TALLER WALLED FILTER TO PREVENT OVERFLOW AND GROUNDS IN YOUR COFFEE - Uniquely designed large commercial coffee filters with taller durable walls that hold up well and don't collapse, to protect against the coffee grounds from overflowing while brewing, making a mess, and prevent finding grounds in your coffee that can ruin your coffee’s tasteCHLORINE FREE - ENVIRONMENTALLY FRIENDLY - The natural color from paper is brown, in order to become white, it must be processed, most papers filters are bleached with chlorine in order to achieve its white color, Tupkee white filters are bleached using oxygen, an elemental chlorine-free (ECF) bleaching method, to ensure there is no detectable level of dioxin, harsh bleach or chemicals in your coffee coffee Measurement 9-3/4\" in diameter at its widest part4-1/4\" in diameter at the base of the filter","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614NwcMqFmL._AC_SL1254_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tupkee","source_asin":"B09R8Y9VGT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-76710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09R8Y9VGT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09R8Y9VGT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":76711,"name":"Pour Over Coffee Maker, Stainless Steel Reusable Coffee Filter, Paperless Manual Coffee Cone Filter, Pour Over Coffee Dripper for (1-4 Cup), Fine Mesh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pEklh5DmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pour Over Coffee Filter, Paperless Coffee Dripper, Manual Reusable Cone Coffee Filter, Paperless Metal Fine Mesh Coffee Strainer with Removable Cup Stand and Bonus Cleaning Brush (1-4 Cup) The Secret Of Optimal Extraction Coffee Grind Size: Medium to Medium-fine grind  Single Cup Coffee Dosage: 10-12g  Coffee to Water Weight Retio: 16  Water Temperature: 195 ~ 205℉ ( 90.6 ~ 96.1°C) Specification Material: Food grade 304 stainless steel  Color: Silvery Stainless Size: 4.1 * 3.74 Inch  Brewing capacity: 1-4 cups (about 800ml) How to Use? 1. Grind 30 grams of coffee (3 tbsp) to a coarseness resembling sea salt. we recommend 23 grams coffee for every 350 grams water.  2. Place the brewer on a carafe or mug. No filter paper required.  3. Add the ground coffee to the dripper and gently tap it to level the surface of the grounds.  4. Pour water in a steady spiral toward the outer edge and then back toward the centerslowly in a circular motion, keeping the water level consistent.  5. Wait for the water to brew.  6. Remove the filter from the cup or pot.  7. Dump the grounds, scrub the filter, & serve from the cup. Package Included: 1 x Pour Over Coffee Filter  1 x Filter Stand  1 x Cleaning Brush 100% Customer Satisfaction If you have anything concerned with the item, please first to choose contact us and we will take care of it for you. here is how Find your order in your amazon account, click the \" contact seller\" button beside the order ID.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pEklh5DmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"U/R","source_asin":"B08T1TG2ZZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-76711","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T1TG2ZZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T1TG2ZZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
