window.products.push({"id":76786,"name":"Euhomy 33Lbs/24H Ice Makers Countertop | Fully Flip Top Cover Design | 9 Clear Ice Ready in 7 Mins, 2 Sizes Ice, Portable Ice Maker with Basket and Sc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":76.55,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IPTG3tKzL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"33Lbs Bigger Capacity & 2 Sizes of Ice: Our ice maker can make 30% more in ice capacity than the ordinary 26lbs bullet ice maker on the market meeting more of your ice needs. Just takes 7-8 mins, you’ll enjoy the first batch of healthy ice. And the ice maker makes 2 different sizes of ice. Small ice for keeping seafood fresh and large ice for rapid cooling beverages. What's more, bullet ice won't stick together easily or melt quickly allowing you to enjoy cold drinks for longer. Exclusive Cleaning Mode for Eating Safety & Smart Sensor: No clean water tank, no pure ice. Euhomy ice maker has a newly design, Fully Openable Lid makes add water or collect ice easier, also more thoroughly clean the inside of ice maker which effectively create fresher, healthier and tasteless ice and even prolong the life of the machine. Our compact ice maker will remind you to add water by flashing \"ADD WATER\" and \"ICE FULL\" flashes when ice is full to move ice into your drinks. Super Efficient & Quieter: Euhomy's ice maker is equipped with a powerful compressor to complete the ice-making fairly quickly. And not only the ice-making noise level is lower than 48db, similar to a working freezer allowing you to enjoy iced drinks in a quiet environment, but also has about 1kWh/10h energy consumption saving electricity bills! In addition, the portable ice maker adopts the see-through window visualized design, allowing direct viewing of the Internal ice making. So Easy & Compact and Portable: Will fall in love with your new nice-looking friend! Self-explanatory LCD panel makes your ice-making process effortless, even for the kids or old. This elegant ice maker is not only great for making all kinds of icy drinks, but also with its compact size of 9.9*14.7*12.3in makes it portable and perfect for anywhere like Home/RV/Camping/Kitchen. The lightweight feature will also wow your guests before they even try the delicious ice it makes! Superior Quality & Warranty Promise: Include ice basket, scoop, manual. Our Mission is committed to providing customers with premium Euhomy ice maker at reasonable price. And we offer ① 12-month warranty from the original purchase date; ② Lifetime technical service support. Suppose you have any questions about using our Countertop Ice Maker, PLEASE reach out to us anytime! Note: Before first use, clean the ice maker and keep it in an upright position for 24 hours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IPTG3tKzL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"E EUHOMY","source_asin":"B09SHB4G7C","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-76786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SHB4G7C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SHB4G7C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
