window.products.push({"id":76815,"name":"The Coffee Seal Coffee Capsule, Stainless Steel Reusable Coffee Pod compatible with Espresso Nespresso Refillable Vertuo Capsule Pod Vertuoline GCA1 a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Bui1llo4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERY IMPORTANT: To make sure the capsule works every single time only use store-bought already ground coffee otherwise, the capsule will clog and you might have issues like, 1) not a full cup of coffee will come out and only a few drops of coffee will come out of the capsule. 2) your machine might make loud noises. 3) your machine might show a red light. to prevent the issues above only use store-bought already ground coffee, I personally use (star ⭐ bucks) medium roast already ground coffee and the capsule works every single time and always makes a strong and delicious cup of coffee, I have suggested this to many customers and they have all confirmed it works great for them when they use store-bought already ground coffee. Please check photos above to see two options on how to use the coffee seal with your vertuoline machine THERE ARE TWO WAYS TO USE THE COFFEE SEAL CAPSULE Option one is only compatible with models-Delonghi ENV135/ Vertuoline GCA1 And is not compatible with vertuoplus models. Option two is compatible with all vertuoline machines For option two you will need a used vertuoline Nespresso capsule. Remove the foil and clean out the capsule, now proceed to the instructions in the picture above. For this option, you are going to be using the coffee seals reusable filter (so no need to purchase any foil seals) and you are going to place the filter on a Nespresso capsule. For full instructions view photos above. Thank you for buying The Coffee Seal!!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Bui1llo4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Coffee Seal","source_asin":"B08T7RJ7DK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-76815","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T7RJ7DK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T7RJ7DK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
